## 6. Technical Architecture

```text
Browser
  │
  ├── HTML/CSS/JavaScript UI
  │
  ├── Supabase JS SDK
  │        │
  │        ├── products
  │        └── reviews
  │
  └── WhatsApp checkout URL

Deployment
  └── Vercel
```

### Main technologies observed in the project

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | HTML, CSS, JavaScript |
| Data/backend service | Supabase |
| Deployment | Vercel |
| Ordering channel | WhatsApp |
| Analytics | Vercel Analytics |
| Fonts/styles | Custom CSS / web font styling |

